   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\"><span class=\"kind\">type alias</span> FieldReceiveHandler <span class=\"sws\"><a href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R25-11/AP/AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_CommunicationManagement.pdf#nameddest=SWS_CM_11615\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF (AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_CommunicationManagement.pdf)\">[SWS_CM_11615]</a></span> <span class=\"ups\">Upstream: <a class=\"swsref\" href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R25-11/AP/AUTOSAR_AP_RS_CommunicationManagement.pdf#nameddest=RS_CM_00203\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF (AUTOSAR_AP_RS_CommunicationManagement.pdf)\">RS_CM_00203</a>, <a class=\"swsref\" href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R25-11/AP/AUTOSAR_AP_RS_General.pdf#nameddest=RS_AP_00114\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF (AUTOSAR_AP_RS_General.pdf)\">RS_AP_00114</a>, <a class=\"swsref\" href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R25-11/AP/AUTOSAR_AP_RS_General.pdf#nameddest=RS_AP_00120\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF (AUTOSAR_AP_RS_General.pdf)\">RS_AP_00120</a></span></h3>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\">using FieldReceiveHandler = <a class=\"cppref\" href=\"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/utility/functional/function\" title=\"cppreference.com (C++17)\">std::function</a>&lt;void()&gt;;</pre>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>Callback function invoked if a new notification arrives for a field. The field receiver must provide the function implementation which is not required to be re-entrant. Usage of std::function is recommended but not mandatory.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n\n"
